=2 Walkthrough
* Talk to {n:Emhi Tchaoryo} to begin this Op.
* Travel to the {n:Allied Ensign} at I-9 in {z:West Sarutabaruta (S)} (hug the left wall as soon as you zone out of {z:Windurst Waters (S)}.
** Once the party leader has selected to enter, you will be transported into {z:Ghoyu's Reverie}.
* The Federation Infantry NPC will run toward a {m:Trained Crab} and begin attacking.
** During this time, you will see messages that display how much attention he is giving to the fight:
*** The knight seems unfocused...
*** The knight has begun to train harder!
*** The knight is fighting with vigor!
* Let the Infantry fight solo until "the knight is fighting with vigor" message appears, then kill the Crab.
** If the soldier never gains focus, you lose the mission.

* Once the crab is defeated, the Mission Objective is complete.
** **Exit via the Dawn Aureola to receive your XP and finish the Campaign Op.**

* Return to {n:Emhi Tchaoryo} for your reward.

=2 Notes
* There seems to be no time limit to how long you can take to get to {z:Ghoyu's Reverie}.
* The Infantry will eventually die if left completely alone, but can cast {s:Cure III} on himself and can tank the Crab long enough to get the "fighting with vigor" message.
* The crab seems to have around 8,000-10,000 HP.

